      "raw": "<p>p214, damage, major, are both \"all heroes in the same location\" and \"all heroes in the scene\" bothn supposed to be mid, as written, or is scene supposed to be min.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>p215, top, twists,&nbsp; \"add a quantity of a threat equal to the Min die\" - in this context, what is a point of threat?&nbsp; This feels like a terminology/methodology change happened and a reference got missed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>p215, twists, Add a challenge - not clear what level of challenge it should be.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>219, Rt, Top. creating lieutenants — \"Lieutenant minions should have[…]\" Is the minions there a copy-paste error?</p>",
