      "raw": "<p>Not a dev, and it looks like you're using an older version of the document, but taking a look at those:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>A subset of heroes, or all heroes and also all villains and NPC's, seem about equally balanced to me.</li>\r\n\t<li>I agree, it's confusing.&nbsp; \"Threats\" can be minions, lieutenants, or villains, and bringing in a die's worth of villains doesn't make a ton of sense here.</li>\r\n\t<li>That's probably intentional, but same as the base scene makes sense.</li>\r\n\t<li>This was fixed in the most recent version.</li>\r\n</ol>",
